cquet-net"}},"text_block_VedJkQ":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/OutdoorTile_3.png","image_width":650,"title":"Multi-Sports Surface Tiles","text":"<p>Versatile, shock-absorbing tiles designed for multiple sports and outdoor activities. Durable, easy to install, and built to deliver a safer, high-performance playing surface.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Multi-Sports Surface Tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/multi-sports-surface-tiles"}}},"block_order":["text_block_ejtkwh","text_block_arzm7t","text_block_NgdDaA","text_block_VedJkQ"],"name":"Complete Your Basketball Setup","settings":{"title":"Essential Badminton Equipment","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"background_video_text_FfMyYg":{"type":"background-video-text","name":"t:sections.background-video-text.presets.large_video_with_text_box.name","settings":{"subtitle":"Recover Between Matches","title":"Bounce Back Faster","text":"<p>Fast-paced rallies demand proper recovery. Explore compression and muscle relief tools to reduce soreness and keep you ready for the next serve.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Recovery","button_link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/recovery","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/416a9ecf6f854a56862dfe9a62b7f000.mp4","color_border":"#f4f4f4","layout":"left","height":550}},"promo_grid_Wy66Vr":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"banner_3iatMw":{"type":"banner","settings":{"heading":"Pinpoint the Pain","text":"Recover with Purpose","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/recovery-by-body-part","label":"Shop Targeted Recovery","color_tint":"#000000","color_tint_opacity":8,"framed":false}}},"block_order":["banner_3iatMw"],"name":"t:sections.promo-grid.presets.promotional_grid.name","settings":{"full_width":true,"gutter_size":0,"space_above":false,"space_below":false}},"promo_grid_atV4qA":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"image_dPrpGt":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/CONBM-Badminton-CondorJrRacquet-800x1000px-1_8c12caef-2045-40e2-a968-b1a5e6a75145.jpg","link":"","width":"33"}},"image_x3dHCT":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/N58Y-Badminton-TournamentShuttlecocks-800x1000px.jpg","link":"","width":"33"}},"image_q8qPbU":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/BN246_360Athletics-Badminton-InstitutionalNet_800x1000px.jpg","link":"","width":"33"}}},"block_order":["image_dPrpGt","image_x3dHCT","image_q8qPbU"],"name":"t:sections.promo-grid.presets.promotional_grid.name","settings":{"full_width":false,"gutter_size":20,"space_above":true,"space_below":true}},"5aa28646d1fec563ef19":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"c17b8470-41ee-4abe-8d7e-edc9ac5270f5":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["c17b8470-41ee-4abe-8d7e-edc9ac5270f5"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Simple Installation"}},"template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1":{"type":"text","disabled":true,"settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p>In four simple and fast steps, you can have your surface fully installed in minutes or less.<\/p><p><strong>Getting Started<\/strong><\/p><p>The panels have two sides with female PowerLocks, and two sides with male PowerLocks. All tiles on any given installation should always have the female PowerLocks going in the same direction.<\/p><p><strong>Step One<\/strong><\/p><p>Begin the installation by laying down your first panel in any one corner and pointing the female PowerLocks in the two directions that additional panels are to be added.<\/p><p><strong>Step Two<\/strong><\/p><p>Place the next panel so that the male PowerLock line up over the top of the female loops on the first panel. It's important to make sure that the female PowerLocks are facing exactly the same direction as the first panel.<\/p><p><strong>Step Three<\/strong><\/p><p>Gently step along the joint of the two panels. You will hear and feel the PowerLocks snap into place as you go.<\/p><p><strong>Step Four<\/strong><\/p><p>Once the two panels are joined, repeat steps one through three remembering to keep the female PowerLocks aligned until your floor is complete. That's all there is to this easy-to-install flooring!<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-0","template--14478213218433__0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2-1678417601549c6456-1"],"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","settings":{"show_product_recommendations":true,"product_recommendations_heading":"You may also like","related_count":5}},"recently-viewed":{"type":"recently-viewed","settings":{"recent_count":5}},"collection-return":{"type":"collection-return","settings":{}},"168078895274d4618a":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"84012a34-7866-4c74-b4f7-16f370ff2d45":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["84012a34-7866-4c74-b4f7-16f370ff2d45"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}}},"order":["main","promo_grid_MPFieY","sub","3eb2f88f-12e5-4f87-aabb-ad99d885f103","f2f4d304-6a8f-48b3-a6cd-0466dc6e11bd","text_columns_DrgNyx","background_video_text_FfMyYg","promo_grid_Wy66Vr","promo_grid_atV4qA","5aa28646d1fec563ef19","0cdbf87b-3e79-4778-b332-d27fd53206c2","product-recommendations","recently-viewed","collection-return","168078895274d4618a"]}